infra
deploy
docs
# NOT cdc: cdc/consumer/Dockerfile COPYs it (COPY cdc ./cdc). Excluding it
# broke the first consumer image build in a demonstration window.
# cdc/connect/Dockerfile copies no local source (it only adds a jar into the
# debezium base image via curl), so it never surfaced this.
# NOT streaming/replay: streaming/ingestor/Dockerfile COPYs it (the ingestor
# imports replay.loader). Excluding it broke the first ingestor image build.
# streaming/flink and streaming/fixtures stay ignored, because neither image
# needs them.
streaming/flink
streaming/fixtures
*.md
!README.md
